---
description: Conventions for editing this super-skill and nested Cursor skills
globs: SKILL.md,README.md,AGENTS.md,.cursor/skills/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

- Treat root `SKILL.md` as the canonical reference; nested `.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` files are focused workflows.
- Keep YAML frontmatter valid: quoted `version`, hyphenated `name`, description that states when to load the skill.
- Nested skill folder name must match the `name` frontmatter field.
- Prefer tables, checklists, and copy-pasteable config over prose.
- Do not dump entire Cursor docs into SKILL.md; link to https://cursor.com/docs and keep local examples short.
- When adding a capability, update the README table, the root TOC, the gap analysis table, and Appendix A.
